<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indictĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				declaration</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					4, 10, 2</span></i>
			; Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 254, 34</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A declaration</i> or <i>imposition</i> of a tax; <i>an impost</i>, <i>tax</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. Pan. 29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dig. 33,
				2, 28</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A space of fifteen years</i>, Cod.Th. 11, 28, 3: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">SECVNDA,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 1160</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>